                "text": "<p>Not because they don't work — because sitting still under a rigid dome for twenty minutes is a commitment people abandon by week three. HaloScalp is cordless and shaped like an ordinary cap, so the session happens while you're doing something else. Consistency is the whole game, and consistency is a design problem before it's a discipline problem.</p>",
